### Set up the OpenTelemetry SDK

The {{ wrapper.wrapperName }} records telemetry through the OpenTelemetry API; your
application owns the SDK that exports it. Both traces and metrics are exported over
OTLP (the supported backends are {{ tw.tracesBackends }} for traces and
{{ tw.metricsBackends }} for metrics). The wrapper registers its tracer and meter
under the instrumentation scope `{{ tw.instrumentationScope }}`.

